# Spec 003 (ADR-007/008), E2E Level 1: public, freely-redistributable test
# ROMs committed under roms/test/ for CI precision tests. Never put a
# commercial ROM here — allowlist each file explicitly, do not blanket-unignore
# the directory.
!roms/test/
!roms/test/nestest.nes
!roms/test/nestest.log

